/* 填写测评（Figma 651:1593）：衬线标题；每题一节的竹节进度；说明提示；整行可点的选项（≥52）；九点量尺横向数字格。 */
page {
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

.detail-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 16rpx var(--p3-page-x) calc(72rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background: var(--p3-paper);
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

.detail-head {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.detail-title {
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.detail-progress-text {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.detail-progress-text__count {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
}

.detail-progress-text__draft {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.detail-progress {
  display: flex;
  gap: 6rpx;
}

.detail-progress__joint {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  height: 12rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: rgba(35, 102, 110, 0.16);
}

.detail-progress__joint--done {
  background: var(--p3-primary);
}

.detail-question {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
  min-width: 0;
}

.detail-question__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.detail-question__num {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-family: var(--p3-font-serif);
  font-size: 48rpx;
  line-height: 64rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 1rpx;
}

.detail-question__prompt {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  padding-top: 8rpx;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 32rpx;
  line-height: 48rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

/* 全部题目默认必答，不再逐题标星；只有少数选填题在题干后轻声注明。 */
.detail-question__optional {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-weight: 400;
}

/* 选项行（Figma 623:101）：整行可点；选中为青瓷浅底 + 1.5 青瓷描边 + 粗边圆点。
   描边计入布局：14/16 内边距 + 1px 描边（选中 1.5px），行高 56。 */
.option-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16rpx;
}

.option-button {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: 112rpx;
  padding: 30rpx 34rpx;
  border-radius: 28rpx;
  background: var(--p3-surface);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2rpx var(--p3-hairline);
}

.option-button--active {
  min-height: 114rpx;
  padding: 31rpx 35rpx;
  background: var(--p3-soft);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3rpx var(--p3-primary);
}

.option-button__radio {
  width: 40rpx;
  height: 40rpx;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.option-button__value {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
}

.option-button__label {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

/* 九点量尺：三列数字格，数字在上、说明在下。 */
.option-row--nine {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 16rpx;
}

.option-row--nine .option-button {
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 4rpx;
  min-height: 112rpx;
  padding: 16rpx 12rpx;
  text-align: center;
}

.option-row--nine .option-button__value {
  font-family: var(--p3-font-serif);
  font-size: 40rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.option-row--nine .option-button__label {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 24rpx;
  line-height: 34rpx;
}

.option-row--nine .option-button--active .option-button__value,
.option-row--nine .option-button--active .option-button__label {
  color: var(--p3-primary);
}

.detail-submit {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.detail-remaining {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.detail-error {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.state-box {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}
